WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Priya Natarajan: Referrals made up twenty-two percent of hires this quarter, up from fifteen percent last quarter.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Maria Chen: That's a strong improvement, do we know which teams are driving most of the referrals?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Priya Natarajan: Engineering and sales are the two biggest contributors, operations is lagging.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Maria Chen: Let's put together a short reminder campaign targeted at operations before next quarter.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:22.000
Priya Natarajan: I'll draft that and share it with the operations leadership team this week.
